    "_about": "The readiness tiers (spec 2026-10-21-home-readiness-onboarding-design.md §3.5). An item is a catalog id, \"@<collection>\" (the collection's books whose own domain is this one) or \"family:<name>\" (any pack of the family; the region's map is chosen in onboarding). catalog_gen.py checks every token, folds essential into comprehensive and generates the efficient and comprehensive presets. \"contains\" maps a ZIM name to the ZIM names whose articles it holds (\"prefix*\" allowed): a held pack counts as installed, and the presets and tier sizes leave it out beside its container (Plan H4).",
