  "onboarding": {
    "_about": "Onboarding's tables (Plan H3, spec 2026-10-21-home-readiness-onboarding-design.md §6). A use case's items use the readiness grammar (a catalog id, \"@<collection>\" for the collection's books, \"family:<name>\" for any pack of the family); the app shows what each adds beyond the start choice and what is installed. regions.larger names the maps packs that are continents or multi-country areas, so the region picker lists countries first; regions.covered names, per larger pack, the places inside it that have no pack of their own, so searching for one finds the pack (Neal, 2026-10-22: Puerto Rico is in Central America). catalog_gen.py checks every token.",
